{ChessBase and Britbase are both missing this game and have me down as Black, but actually I was White and I do remember that it began} 1. e4 e5 2. Bc4 Nf6 3. Nc3 {Or possibly 3 d3 Nc6 4 Nc3 first but probably I invited the Frankenstein-Dracula knowing Les would not go for it.} Nc6 4. d3 Na5 5. Nge2 Nxc4 6. dxc4 Bc5 7. O-O d6 8. Qd3 {"with a slight advantage to White"; Harding, Vienna Opening, page 93. The game was drawn after about 12-15 moves if I recall correctly.} 1/2-1/2

